## How we know

The alert was triggered by a single Jest test failure. The test 'metrics query embed > charts a grouped aggregate above its table' produced the error spans, and no prior failures for this test were found in the last 7 days. See the attached trace and recurrence analysis for details.

{% trace %}{"trace_id": "c7d9f4a2b18e4c3fa05d6e7182934bcd"}{% /trace %}

## What happened

The alert was triggered by a single Jest test failure at 14:09:34 UTC. Two error spans from the test "metrics query embed > charts a grouped aggregate above its table" breached the monitor's zero threshold. See trace `c7d9f4a2b18e4c3fa05d6e7182934bcd` for details.

{% trace %}{"trace_id": "c7d9f4a2b18e4c3fa05d6e7182934bcd"}{% /trace %}

## What to do next

Fix the failing Jest test "metrics query embed > charts a grouped aggregate above its table" to resolve the underlying issue. Also, update the "Span errors in ci:master" monitor by increasing its threshold above 0 and consider adding a baseline comparison to reduce sensitivity.

{% trace %}{"trace_id": "c7d9f4a2b18e4c3fa05d6e7182934bcd"}{% /trace %}
